The preview is distributed under CC BY-SA 4.0. It shows the wallpaper in a
real Omarchy desktop session with terminal and editor windows over it.
Changes: desktop compositing, 16:9 crop, downsampling to 1200x675, WebP
compression, and removal of screenshot metadata. The source photographer
adjusted highlights and curves and cloned out a crane.
